uncovered detection
├── when a source file has tests but no tree
│   └── it is reported with its test count
├── when a tree spec exists next to the file
│   └── it is not reported
├── when a source file has no tests
│   └── it is not reported
├── when a tree routes to only one of two candidates
│   └── it reports the unrouted candidate
└── when a candidate cannot be scanned
    └── it is reported as failed
